{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣男神許光漢將於本月31日迎來36歲生日，特別準備「逆應援」大禮寵粉！</p><p>經理人公司宣布將送出50頂限定「親筆簽名帽」，消息一出隨即引發粉絲暴動。</p><p>沒想到抽獎題目暗藏玄機，官方竟直接考驗鐵粉忠誠度發問：「許光漢睡覺習慣睡哪一邊？</p><p>」這道看似私密的</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T16:20:49.595110+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T16:01:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T16:18:10.925504+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T16:18:10.925504+00:00","content_hash":"734a24c71b054b298ab37d4cab05e994133951a95e757108f15f237d59cbb358","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}